    {
      "@id": "./",
      "@type": "schema:Dataset",
      "name": "taylor couette problem",
      "description": "\\ingroup NavierStokesTests\n\\brief Taylor-Couette flow between two concentric rotating cylinders\n\nThe inner cylinder of radius \\f$ R_1 \\f$ rotates with the angular velocity \\f$ \\Omega_1 \\f$,\nthe outer cylinder of radius \\f$ R_2 \\f$ with \\f$ \\Omega_2 \\f$. The circular Couette flow\n\\f$ u_\\theta = A r + B/r \\f$ with\n\\f$ A = (\\Omega_2 R_2^2 - \\Omega_1 R_1^2)/(R_2^2 - R_1^2) \\f$ and\n\\f$ B = (\\Omega_1 - \\Omega_2) R_1^2 R_2^2/(R_2^2 - R_1^2) \\f$\nis a steady solution of the Navier-Stokes equations, and the pressure follows from\n\\f$ \\partial p/\\partial r = \\rho u_\\theta^2/r \\f$ \\cite taylor1923.\nThe velocity is prescribed on both cylinders.",
      "datePublished": "2026-11-06",
      "license": {
        "@id": "https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-or-later.html"
      },
      "hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "local:bm-taylor_couette_problem"
        },
        {
          "@id": "local:parameter_file_object"
        },
        {
          "@id": "local:summary_file_object"
        }
      ],
      "codeRepository": "https://github.com/Simulation-Benchmarks/benchmantic.git"
    },
